WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.980
<b>Followers</b>

00:06.360 --> 00:07.650
Amazing!

00:07.820 --> 00:09.120
Salvation Through Mitama's Sacred Singing Troupe

00:20.090 --> 00:24.300
Welcome to the live show of the Salvation 
Through Mitama's Sacred Singing Troupe!

00:24.300 --> 00:27.270
Let's all get really fired up!

00:27.270 --> 00:29.710
Yeah!

00:29.710 --> 00:31.560
Siluril, you're so cool!

00:35.490 --> 00:38.270
It took some time to get here,

00:38.710 --> 00:40.800
but it's more successful than I dreamed.

00:40.800 --> 00:45.570
Why am I not the one who's on stage?!

00:45.570 --> 00:47.260
This has nothing to do with religion!

00:47.260 --> 00:49.680
This is just a gathering 
of a band and its fans!

00:49.680 --> 00:53.100
Let me get on the damn stage!

02:15.990 --> 02:20.990
Episode 10
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama

02:16.400 --> 02:19.610
We know we are not worthy

02:19.610 --> 02:20.990
O great Lord Mitama

02:21.450 --> 02:23.490
Our first move to strike back will be

02:23.490 --> 02:28.160
that I'll become the producer 
for the next-gen song princess!

02:28.160 --> 02:30.880
Yukito, did you say song princess?

02:31.210 --> 02:34.500
I suppose you need me again, huh?

02:34.500 --> 02:38.300
The genius god-style idol 
Mitama-chan is here for you!

02:38.300 --> 02:40.050
No, I won't use you.

02:40.840 --> 02:46.310
It was foolish to try to set you up as an idol
 during the initial phase of our faith.

02:46.310 --> 02:48.180
That's a dark chapter for me.

02:48.180 --> 02:50.190
A dark... chapter...

02:51.980 --> 02:55.110
So, what do you guys know about music?

02:55.110 --> 02:57.940
Are you good at singing 
or playing an instrument?

02:57.940 --> 02:59.150
Hmm.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.200
First of all,

03:00.200 --> 03:02.740
what is this "music"?

03:03.620 --> 03:05.080
Ah, I see.

03:05.910 --> 03:09.910
I had taught Roy about song and dance before,

03:09.910 --> 03:14.250
but it looks like "music" is basically 
completely unknown in this world.

03:14.250 --> 03:18.840
I guess the assembly and the 
Emperor erased all traces of it.

03:18.840 --> 03:23.260
Then, our first task is to bring back 
the concept of "music" to this world.

03:26.100 --> 03:30.350
Al! Sil! Atar!

03:27.890 --> 03:30.350
Hm? What's that sound?

03:30.350 --> 03:31.770
You don't know?

03:32.230 --> 03:33.940
It's "music".

03:36.190 --> 03:37.400
Yay.

03:45.070 --> 03:46.240
Good.

03:46.240 --> 03:49.660
It seems music is starting to become 
part of their everyday lives.

03:51.410 --> 03:54.330
I'm the one who summoned 
the instruments and gear,

03:54.330 --> 03:56.920
so why am I not the the center of atten—

04:17.560 --> 04:19.320
Stop it, Bertrand!

04:19.320 --> 04:21.820
You're not cut out for music!

04:26.740 --> 04:29.030
Don't give up on me!

04:29.540 --> 04:31.370
Please don't give up on me!

04:33.790 --> 04:37.130
Al, Sil, Atar, Gaia.

04:37.130 --> 04:39.090
Starting today, you're going to to be our...

04:41.420 --> 04:42.260
There.

04:43.720 --> 04:44.930
Sacred singing troupe!

04:49.220 --> 04:50.140
Look at that.

04:50.930 --> 04:54.730
Humans have a psychological tendency to 
want to go along with their surroundings.

04:54.730 --> 04:58.360
Once music is popularized 
to a certain degree,

04:58.360 --> 05:00.820
it'll turn into an unstoppable wave.

05:02.230 --> 05:04.110
I'm the god of this religious group!

05:04.400 --> 05:08.570
I am the one who ought to be 
admired and revered on that stage!

05:13.950 --> 05:14.750
Huh?

05:15.250 --> 05:17.210
My power is overflowing...

05:17.710 --> 05:20.590
Did I gain more followers?!

05:20.590 --> 05:22.800
Wait, it's the same as before!

05:21.050 --> 05:23.760
<b>Followers</b>

05:22.800 --> 05:23.760
What gives?!

05:23.760 --> 05:26.380
This event is also an experiment.

05:26.680 --> 05:29.680
Remember when Al and Sil 
became your first followers?

05:29.680 --> 05:32.680
Back then, your powers grew 
disproportionately large.

05:32.680 --> 05:35.020
That could have been a thing...

05:35.020 --> 05:39.230
It seems a god's power is not purely 
based on the number of followers.

05:39.230 --> 05:43.190
Those two had something else 
going for them as well.

05:43.820 --> 05:44.530
Hmm.

05:44.860 --> 05:46.530
Take faith.

05:46.530 --> 05:50.570
It's a measure of how strongly people trust 
in their god and how united they are.

05:50.820 --> 05:53.830
Our group is a community that 
is bound by personal advantages,

05:53.830 --> 05:55.540
so it's weak in that regard.

05:56.080 --> 05:59.040
Since music increases the sense 
of unity among the followers,

05:59.040 --> 06:02.250
various religious organizations have 
been using it since ancient times.

06:03.210 --> 06:06.590
It has the potential to 
make up for our weakness.

06:07.170 --> 06:11.890
Well, I suppose that's why the 
Emperor erased music to begin with.

06:13.720 --> 06:15.430
My Yukito's so smart!

06:15.430 --> 06:18.690
All right, now that I'm powered up,

06:18.690 --> 06:20.650
I'm going to go tear Loki to pieces!

06:20.650 --> 06:21.690
Wait.

06:21.690 --> 06:23.190
Before that...

06:23.940 --> 06:26.530
there's someone else we need to crush.

06:31.320 --> 06:33.830
I am so utterly useless...

06:34.490 --> 06:35.540
Bertrand.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.750
You can't play instruments, 
you can't sing or dance.

06:39.750 --> 06:42.380
Even as a fighter you're not that useful.

06:43.630 --> 06:46.420
Y-Yukito, please...

06:46.420 --> 06:47.420
don't abandon me.

06:47.420 --> 06:48.550
You're...

06:53.430 --> 06:55.890
still dearly needed.

07:01.730 --> 07:02.770
Why?

07:04.360 --> 07:08.570
Bertrand, there are things 
that only you can do.

07:09.900 --> 07:13.240
So I... can stay here?

07:13.450 --> 07:14.370
Yes.

07:14.370 --> 07:17.120
The only place for you is in our group.

07:17.620 --> 07:22.040
The only ones who will take 
me in is this religious group?

07:22.040 --> 07:23.170
That's right.

07:23.750 --> 07:26.250
And what is it you can do for our group?

07:26.840 --> 07:27.920
I...

07:29.090 --> 07:32.050
will do anything for our group!

07:34.550 --> 07:35.390
Good.

07:36.050 --> 07:37.890
I will give you your task now.

07:38.430 --> 07:39.390
And that is to...

07:47.940 --> 07:49.610
Just as Yukito told me,

07:49.610 --> 07:52.400
I'm tailing and observing 
what Gaia is doing...

07:52.400 --> 07:56.660
Let's get some work done today.

08:10.260 --> 08:12.970
<i>What could she be doing at a 
branch village of our group?</i>

08:14.010 --> 08:16.390
Hey, you guys.

08:16.760 --> 08:19.680
Can I ask you something?

08:20.600 --> 08:22.940
Wait, is she going to attack those children?!

08:22.940 --> 08:25.980
Oh, no! I suddenly feel dizzy.

08:25.980 --> 08:27.310
Eek.

08:28.400 --> 08:30.570
Oh, no! Are you all right?!

08:30.570 --> 08:34.490
I'm sorry. You saved me.

08:34.490 --> 08:35.740
I know!

08:35.740 --> 08:39.870
Would you like to come to my house 
so I can properly thank you?

08:39.870 --> 08:42.660
I have a lot of tasty treats.

08:44.620 --> 08:47.750
We were told to not go with strangers.

08:47.750 --> 08:49.250
See you later.

08:50.500 --> 08:52.630
Oh, well. Let's try another one.

08:53.050 --> 08:54.840
What was that about?

08:57.760 --> 08:59.510
N-No!

08:59.510 --> 09:01.060
A strange beast is attacking a child?!

09:01.680 --> 09:03.560
I... I won't make it on time!

09:05.060 --> 09:07.230
There, there.

09:07.230 --> 09:10.980
You were just a little peckish, weren't you?

09:12.570 --> 09:14.070
Don't worry, it's fine now.

09:14.070 --> 09:16.780
Why don't I take you somewhere saf—

09:19.490 --> 09:20.700
Huh?

09:20.700 --> 09:21.950
Eek!

09:21.950 --> 09:23.830
Hey, wait!

09:25.580 --> 09:27.000
Enough.

09:27.500 --> 09:28.830
Let go.

09:30.710 --> 09:33.010
All that acting for nothing.

09:33.010 --> 09:35.840
You went too far by really biting down.

09:35.840 --> 09:38.430
There are only a few children at 
these isolation camp villages,

09:38.430 --> 09:41.010
so I don't want to miss my chance.

09:41.010 --> 09:42.140
You got that?

09:48.520 --> 09:50.190
What is she doing?

10:02.200 --> 10:03.870
What the...?

10:03.870 --> 10:07.660
This area is not supposed to be affiliated 
with any isolation camp village.

10:07.660 --> 10:09.540
Why is there a house here?

10:11.340 --> 10:12.880
Welcome home, Mom!

10:13.920 --> 10:15.300
Welcome home.

10:15.300 --> 10:16.670
I'm back.

10:16.670 --> 10:19.090
We were worried because you were late today.

10:19.090 --> 10:20.180
I'm sorry,

10:20.180 --> 10:22.970
I was taking care of a bunch of things.

10:23.600 --> 10:26.350
I'll get started on dinner right away.

10:26.850 --> 10:28.140
We'll help.

10:28.140 --> 10:30.190
Okay, thank you.

10:30.190 --> 10:31.610
Come on, you guys, too.

10:31.610 --> 10:33.400
OK!

10:36.110 --> 10:39.320
I see, so that's Gaia's religious group.

10:39.320 --> 10:40.200
Huh?

10:40.200 --> 10:42.370
The smallest possible form 
of religion is a "family".

10:43.030 --> 10:45.580
Each family has its own rituals,

10:45.580 --> 10:47.700
the head of the family is the leader,

10:47.700 --> 10:50.250
and the bonds between members is strong.

10:50.250 --> 10:52.790
A family is a religious 
organization in itself.

10:53.250 --> 10:54.340
In fact,

10:54.340 --> 10:57.670
in the land I used to live,

10:57.670 --> 11:01.130
many of the great religions 
started as  family religions.

11:02.430 --> 11:06.220
Hmph, it's a loser group 
with merely five followers.

11:06.220 --> 11:08.680
Mitama-sama's power will crush them easily!

11:09.230 --> 11:10.060
Munch!

11:10.730 --> 11:13.690
A family religion's strength 
lies in its unity.

11:13.690 --> 11:15.440
We've proven that the 
stronger the enthusiasm,

11:15.440 --> 11:18.280
the stronger the god's power.

11:18.280 --> 11:21.910
We can't just take the number 
of followers at face value.

11:22.450 --> 11:28.040
Besides, Gaia might also be advancing her own 
schemes with information we don't have yet.

11:28.040 --> 11:31.830
We can't rush it, but we should 
still crush her swiftly.

11:31.830 --> 11:33.330
How, though?

11:33.330 --> 11:36.420
There is one way to deal 
with family religions.

11:40.260 --> 11:42.260
Depose the leader.

11:43.180 --> 11:45.970
We're going to absorb her group in one go.

11:45.970 --> 11:47.600
Thank you, Bertrand.

11:48.430 --> 11:51.640
Since you tailed Gaia perfectly,

11:51.640 --> 11:53.350
we can strike first.

11:55.150 --> 11:56.650
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

11:57.190 --> 11:59.230
<i>I can't look at Yukito's face...</i>

11:59.230 --> 12:02.570
<i>Yukito said he needed me.</i>

12:02.570 --> 12:05.370
<i>But he meant as a member 
of our religious group,</i>

12:05.370 --> 12:06.990
<i>not me personally.</i>

12:06.990 --> 12:08.790
<i>I can't take it the wrong way.</i>

12:08.790 --> 12:12.620
<i>I just need to follow 
what our group says...</i>

12:12.620 --> 12:17.420
In order to deal with her 
group's strong familial bond,

12:17.920 --> 12:20.050
it's time for me to make this call.

12:23.510 --> 12:24.180
There you ar—

12:25.180 --> 12:26.300
Bertrand?

12:27.390 --> 12:28.140
What the...?!

12:30.720 --> 12:32.230
What are you doing?!

12:33.520 --> 12:34.600
What?!

12:39.440 --> 12:40.650
Yukito,

12:42.070 --> 12:43.860
this is your own fault.

12:45.450 --> 12:47.820
After you were so nice to me,

12:47.820 --> 12:49.450
I can't resist anymore.

12:49.830 --> 12:51.160
Hold on!

12:53.410 --> 12:54.460
Stop!

12:54.460 --> 12:55.670
You're a man, aren't you?!

12:55.670 --> 12:57.580
Right now, I'm a woman.

12:57.580 --> 13:00.460
Besides, precisely because 
I used to be a man,

13:00.460 --> 13:03.630
I should know what feels good.

13:04.170 --> 13:05.180
<i>This is weird.</i>

13:05.180 --> 13:07.220
<i>This level of lust is...!</i>

13:07.220 --> 13:07.890
Dakini!

13:07.890 --> 13:09.350
You did this!

13:09.350 --> 13:11.390
Correctomundo!

13:11.390 --> 13:13.890
Turn off your power right now!

13:13.890 --> 13:14.850
Never.

13:14.850 --> 13:17.310
Please just get eaten.

13:22.230 --> 13:25.070
Stop!

13:26.660 --> 13:28.700
Ouch!

13:26.660 --> 13:28.700
That's quite enough.

13:28.700 --> 13:29.830
Riche-tan.

13:29.830 --> 13:32.160
But it was just about to get good.

13:32.160 --> 13:34.040
Please turn off your power.

13:34.040 --> 13:35.210
Boo.

13:37.370 --> 13:39.330
That shape brings back memories.

13:39.330 --> 13:41.210
So that's Yukito's...

13:42.630 --> 13:45.170
Ugh, what happened?

13:45.970 --> 13:47.510
Oh, what's that?

13:47.510 --> 13:49.430
The first thing you did 
was hide your breasts.

13:49.430 --> 13:51.760
You really are a girl now.

13:52.310 --> 13:54.140
Wh-Wh-What?!

13:54.140 --> 13:57.020
You used to be a man, right?

13:57.020 --> 13:58.270
But, you know?

13:58.270 --> 13:59.810
You should just admit and say it:

13:59.810 --> 14:02.650
"I'm a girl, body and soul."

14:02.650 --> 14:04.480
N-No...

14:04.480 --> 14:09.160
And "In reality, I'm a female knight 
who loves sexual intercourse."

14:09.160 --> 14:10.570
I'm...

14:19.000 --> 14:21.630
Dakini, how dare you?

14:21.630 --> 14:23.000
"How dare you?"

14:23.000 --> 14:25.510
You do know that that's my line?

14:26.090 --> 14:29.380
Don't tell me you forgot what you did to us.

14:29.760 --> 14:33.890
You've got balls to call us 
here like we're your gofers.

14:33.890 --> 14:36.810
I kept it in until now for Riche-tan's sake,

14:36.810 --> 14:39.390
but if you're going to be like that...

14:43.690 --> 14:46.570
I just can't help but bust a move!

14:49.200 --> 14:50.070
What?

14:50.070 --> 14:50.950
Actually,

14:50.950 --> 14:54.080
this "music" you taught us about the other 
day is really popular with our followers.

14:54.080 --> 14:57.450
They really enjoy it when 
they're making love.

14:57.450 --> 14:58.790
As you can see,

14:58.790 --> 15:01.120
Dakini-sama herself has taken 
a liking to it, as well.

15:01.120 --> 15:04.340
Well, I'm glad it proved useful.

15:04.340 --> 15:08.380
"Music" has the effect of altering 
the mental state of humans.

15:08.380 --> 15:11.640
You should be able to use it to spread 
and normalize your rituals, as well.

15:11.640 --> 15:13.510
Yuki-tan, I changed my mind about you!

15:13.510 --> 15:16.260
You know some good stuff, 
despite being a virgin!

15:16.260 --> 15:22.520
Well, the revival and free expression of 
love are helpful for our group's goals, as well.

15:22.520 --> 15:24.690
We will help wherever we can.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.280
Then I suppose we're in 
the same boat for now.

15:29.280 --> 15:31.780
So what did you call us here for?

15:31.780 --> 15:34.120
There's something I need you to do.

15:49.630 --> 15:51.630
Everyone, it's morning.

15:51.630 --> 15:53.050
Get up!

15:55.600 --> 15:58.260
Did you pull an all-nighter again, Yushii?

15:58.260 --> 16:02.390
Yeah, the books from the old 
world that mom brought are fun.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.810
Fau, Cain!

16:03.810 --> 16:06.940
Don't be all sloppy just 
because mommy Gaia isn't here!

16:08.650 --> 16:10.650
Fau, you're cramping me.

16:10.650 --> 16:12.950
Sleep in your own bed.

16:15.530 --> 16:16.530
Huh?

16:17.030 --> 16:18.740
It looks different from the banned book.

16:18.740 --> 16:20.200
Why?

16:18.740 --> 16:21.200
Gimme back my underwear!

16:23.040 --> 16:25.210
Stop fooling around, Fau!

16:25.210 --> 16:28.000
And, Cain, you stop crying 
over stuff like that!

16:28.000 --> 16:29.420
Okay...

16:29.800 --> 16:31.130
All right everyone!

16:31.130 --> 16:33.050
Wash your faces, eat breakfast,

16:33.050 --> 16:34.630
and everybody does their chores.

16:37.260 --> 16:39.760
Where are Kai and Cyan?

16:39.760 --> 16:42.850
They went to check if anything 
got caught in the trap.

16:42.850 --> 16:44.520
Hey, guys.

16:46.020 --> 16:49.360
Want to do something fun with me?

16:50.650 --> 16:54.700
I'll teach you something really fun.

17:01.290 --> 17:02.450
Fu**ing tempo!

17:02.450 --> 17:03.960
Fu**ing tempo!

17:03.960 --> 17:07.170
Are you farting with the drums or what?

17:07.170 --> 17:08.290
Fu**ing tempo!

17:08.290 --> 17:10.000
Fu**ing tempo!

17:10.000 --> 17:13.170
<i>I haven't been able to go 
home the last few days.</i>

17:11.550 --> 17:12.880
Fu**ing tempo!

17:12.880 --> 17:14.470
Fu**ing tempo!

17:13.170 --> 17:16.090
<i>If anything happened to my children...</i>

17:14.470 --> 17:16.090
Fu**ing tempo!

17:16.090 --> 17:20.140
<i>But I guess it's going to be complete 
soon, so it should be fine.</i>

17:16.590 --> 17:18.390
Fu**ing tempo!

17:18.510 --> 17:19.760
Fu**ing tempo!

17:19.930 --> 17:21.140
Fu**ing tempo!

17:21.140 --> 17:22.640
What's so funny?!

17:22.640 --> 17:26.100
Do you know what happens 
when you laugh at a god?!

17:26.100 --> 17:28.100
Al, Sil, Atar!

17:28.100 --> 17:29.360
You guys get in there, too!

17:51.290 --> 17:52.880
Have you noticed?

17:53.130 --> 17:56.380
Our siblings have been 
weird the last few days.

17:56.380 --> 18:00.550
Yes, someone's trying to destroy our family.

18:00.550 --> 18:02.890
Wow, it squirts that far?!

18:04.180 --> 18:05.890
I'm soaking wet!

18:05.890 --> 18:08.980
I'll get you back by pumping this!

18:08.980 --> 18:10.520
Cain, I want it, too!

18:10.520 --> 18:12.900
Don't run away now!

18:13.860 --> 18:16.320
What are those kids doing?!

18:20.410 --> 18:23.490
Oh, crap, that was a huge load!

18:24.620 --> 18:26.910
Why don't you guys join in, too?

18:28.210 --> 18:30.040
<i>Sorry, Yukitan,</i>

18:30.040 --> 18:33.500
<i>but I am going to save these 
children without using my powers.</i>

18:34.050 --> 18:37.010
You want me to steal Gaia's family from her?

18:38.090 --> 18:39.630
How?

18:40.680 --> 18:45.270
Just use your powers to 
make the children love you.

18:45.270 --> 18:47.680
That's such a brutish plan.

18:48.940 --> 18:51.650
Is it me, or are you like, panicky?

18:52.150 --> 18:56.070
If I could, I wouldn't even ask 
someone I can't fully trust.

18:56.070 --> 18:57.780
Then, why me?

18:58.030 --> 19:02.280
I just want to save these children.

19:02.280 --> 19:03.580
Save?

19:03.580 --> 19:04.950
Before I came here,

19:04.950 --> 19:07.540
I used to live in another country.

19:07.540 --> 19:08.710
Since I was in a special position,

19:08.710 --> 19:11.080
I never got to have a normal childhood.

19:11.670 --> 19:15.920
My father educated me so that I 
would become a useful pawn to him.

19:16.170 --> 19:19.300
To him, I was nothing but a tool.

19:19.300 --> 19:21.840
Just like the children of the Empire.

19:23.430 --> 19:25.510
They're robbed of their humanity,

19:25.510 --> 19:29.230
only kept alive as a tool 
for perpetuating the group.

19:31.310 --> 19:34.060
You understand that, don't you, Dakini?

19:35.110 --> 19:38.780
I've heard a bit about your past from Riche.

19:39.280 --> 19:41.450
I won't forgive you for what you did,

19:41.450 --> 19:42.780
and I don't like it.

19:42.780 --> 19:44.240
But for now, it's what we've got.

19:45.240 --> 19:50.000
Anyway, these kids are being 
used so Gaia can gain power.

19:50.290 --> 19:53.290
It's clear as day what happens 
to exploited children.

19:53.290 --> 19:55.750
Once they lose their value, 
they will be discarded.

19:56.000 --> 19:58.550
Children are not tools 
for their parents to use.

19:58.550 --> 20:01.170
Those kids must not remain 
under Gaia's control!

20:09.060 --> 20:10.390
Just so you know.

20:10.390 --> 20:12.350
I am not doing this for you.

20:12.560 --> 20:16.150
I have a responsibility towards 
this country's children.

20:16.150 --> 20:17.980
I'm just paying my dues for that.

20:21.280 --> 20:26.370
I knew that stirring up her past was 
the best way to make Dakini act.

20:26.740 --> 20:30.620
Now I just have to confirm that 
Gaia's power wanes and then-

20:31.540 --> 20:32.620
Huh?

20:32.620 --> 20:36.080
I guess my past got stirred up, too...

20:37.290 --> 20:40.760
Why are you with a stranger?

20:40.760 --> 20:42.220
Did you forget what Mom said?

20:42.220 --> 20:44.300
Those who betray the family...

20:44.970 --> 20:46.470
Hold up.

20:46.470 --> 20:49.010
These kids were just playing with me.

20:49.010 --> 20:50.520
What's so wrong with that?

20:52.640 --> 20:55.230
Don't interact with anyone 
outside the family.

20:55.230 --> 20:57.110
That's one of Mom's rules.

20:58.020 --> 21:00.230
So you blindly believe in your mom, huh?

21:00.230 --> 21:03.070
An outsider has no business 
butting into our family.

21:03.070 --> 21:06.820
Mom said that family matters 
have to be settled internally.

21:06.820 --> 21:10.160
But there are things that you 
can't solve just by yourselves.

21:10.160 --> 21:11.580
You guys, please believe us!

21:11.580 --> 21:13.710
Dakini is a nice adult!

21:13.710 --> 21:16.000
You should play with us, too.

21:16.000 --> 21:18.250
I'm sure Mom would understand.

21:19.130 --> 21:21.710
Hey, Cyan-chan, Kai-kun.

21:21.920 --> 21:24.630
Could it be that you're being 
forced to be a "family"?

21:25.680 --> 21:29.300
A real family should be a lot more relaxed.

21:29.300 --> 21:30.680
So you guys should also—

21:30.680 --> 21:31.680
What?

21:32.430 --> 21:34.480
What is a "real family"?

21:35.100 --> 21:36.600
I don't know what you're saying.

21:37.100 --> 21:38.020
What?

21:38.020 --> 21:40.770
This one's different than the others.

21:40.770 --> 21:42.570
You don't know anything.

21:42.570 --> 21:46.650
Neither you, nor Fau, nor Cain, nor Yushii...

21:47.160 --> 21:50.200
So I'll make you see.

21:50.580 --> 21:52.240
Wait, what?!

21:54.580 --> 21:55.620
Strange beasts?!

21:57.120 --> 21:58.000
Guys!

21:58.000 --> 21:59.420
Dakini!

21:59.960 --> 22:02.550
They're being controlled by them?

22:02.550 --> 22:05.720
Crap, with my current strength 
I can't do anything.

22:06.130 --> 22:09.140
Please calm down and let me explain first...

22:10.970 --> 22:11.970
Get them.

